flowchart LR
    PBF[Regional OSM PBF] -->|upload| RAW[S3 raw bucket]
    RAW -->|Batch job role reads| JOB[AWS Batch Fargate job]
    JOB -->|PyOsmium streaming parser| PARQUET[Local rotating Parquet files]
    PARQUET -->|upload| STAGE[S3 curated staging prefix]
    STAGE -->|copy data, then manifest| CURATED[S3 curated region/date/entity layout]
    CURATED --> CATALOG[Glue projected table<br/>region / ymd injected]
    CATALOG --> ATHENA[Amazon Athena]

    ECR[Amazon ECR] --> JOB
    JOB --> CW[CloudWatch Logs]
    JOB -. task execution role .-> ECR
